{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫גֶף","hw":"נֶ֫גֶף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫גֶף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:13\" href=\"/Exodus.12.13\">Ex 12:13</a></sup> <strong>blow, striking</strong> (as judgment, only P);—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:13\" href=\"/Exodus.12.13\">Ex 12:13</a> + 6 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  fatal <em>blow, plague</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:13\" href=\"/Exodus.12.13\">Ex 12:13</a> (death of first-born); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:12\" href=\"/Exodus.30.12\">30:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 8:19\" href=\"/Numbers.8.19\">Nu 8:19</a> (indef.); = pestilence <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:11\" href=\"/Numbers.17.11\">Nu 17:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:12\" href=\"/Numbers.17.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:17\" href=\"/Joshua.22.17\">Jos 22:17</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>striking</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.14\">Is 8:14</a> i.e. against which the foot strikes and so stumbles (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צוּר מִכְשׁוֹל</span>).","next":"BDB, מַגֵּפָה²","prev":"BDB, נָגַף"}